{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45529","headline":"秋日江居闲咏 · 卿云","name":"秋日江居闲咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寄居江岛边，闲咏见秋残。\n草白牛羊瘦，风高猨鸟寒。\n检方医故疾，挑荠备中餐。\n时复停书卷，鉏莎种木兰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卿云","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45529.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45529","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}